  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Omstrukt BiH j&#xe4;rnv&#xe4;g, I</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Restruct BiH Railways, I - Restruct BiH Railways</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance to the process of restructuring BiH railways. The project consists of three phases. The first phase, implemented by SwedeRail, will last 5 months and contains a Startup Seminar and a Market Study. The goal is to assist the reconstruction of BiH economy by adapting the BiH railways to a market economy.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till omstruktureringsprocessen f&#xf6;r BiHs j&#xe4;rnv&#xe4;gssektor. Projekte best&#xe5;r av tre faser varav den f&#xf6;rsta genomf&#xf6;rs av SwedeRail och p&#xe5;g&#xe5;r i 5 m&#xe5;nader. F&#xf6;rsta fasen inneh&#xe5;ller ett f&#xf6;rberedande seminarium och en marknadsstudie. M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att st&#xf6;dja utvecklingen av BiHs ekonomi genom att anpassa j&#xe4;rnv&#xe4;gssektorn till marknadsekonomins krav.</narrative>
  </description>
